          "content": {
            "title": "Skills You'll Master",
            "explanation": "",
            "audio": "You will master the complete modern AI engineering toolkit including Python, FastAPI, Machine Learning, Deep Learning, NLP, Prompt Engineering, LLMs, RAG, LangChain, LangGraph, AI Agents, Vector Databases, React, Docker, Cloud Deployment, and the MCP Protocol.",
            "html_code": "<style>\n  .skill-pill {\n    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, background 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  .skill-pill:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.05);\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(139,92,246,0.15);\n    border-color: rgba(139,92,246,0.4) !important;\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.06), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) !important;\n  }\n  .skill-pill:hover .skill-text {\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n</style>\n<div style=\"padding:16px 0;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,20px);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 48px auto;line-height:1.6;font-weight:400;margin-top:0;\">The complete modern AI engineering toolkit.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;\">\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">🐍</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Python</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">⚡</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">FastAPI</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">🧠</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Machine Learning</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">🔮</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Deep Learning</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">📝</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">NLP</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">✍️</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Prompt Engineering</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">💎</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">LLMs</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">🔍</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">RAG</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">🦜</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">LangChain</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">🕸️</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">LangGraph</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">🤖</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">AI Agents</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">🗄️</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Vector Databases</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">⚛️</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">React</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">🐳</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Docker</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">☁️</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Cloud Deploy</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"skill-pill\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:22px;\">🔌</span>\n    <span class=\"skill-text\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);transition:color 0.3s ease;\">MCP Protocol</span>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "Why This Course Is Different",
            "explanation": "",
            "audio": "This is not another video course. Traditional courses make you watch. This one makes you build. Features include gamified learning, in-browser coding, real projects, AI-powered mentoring, production architecture patterns, and career-focused content.",
            "html_code": "<style>\n  .feature-card {\n    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  .feature-card:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-8px);\n    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15) !important;\n  }\n  .feature-card:hover .feature-icon {\n    transform: scale(1.15) rotate(5deg);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(255,255,255,0.2) !important;\n  }\n</style>\n<div style=\"padding:16px 0;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;\">\n    <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;padding:6px 18px;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.15);color:#8b5cf6;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:16px;padding:8px 24px;\">Why Us</div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);font-weight:800;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #c4b5fd 0%, #8b5cf6 50%, #3b82f6 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 16px 0;text-align:center;\">Not another video course.</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,20px);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 48px auto;line-height:1.6;font-weight:400;\">Traditional courses make you watch. This one makes you build.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);gap:16px;\">\n  <div class=\"feature-card\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:20px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <div class=\"feature-icon\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(168,85,247,0.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:0 0 20px #a855f730;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">🎮</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin:0 0 8px 0;transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Learn by Playing</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin:0;line-height:1.6;\">Gamified XP system with levels, achievements, and streaks.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"feature-card\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:20px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <div class=\"feature-icon\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(59,130,246,0.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:0 0 20px #3b82f630;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">💻</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin:0 0 8px 0;transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Code in Browser</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin:0;line-height:1.6;\">Write and run code instantly. No setup required.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"feature-card\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:20px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <div class=\"feature-icon\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:0 0 20px #10b98130;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">🏗️</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin:0 0 8px 0;transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Build Real Projects</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin:0;line-height:1.6;\">Portfolio-ready applications, not toy examples.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"feature-card\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:20px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <div class=\"feature-icon\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(6,182,212,0.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:0 0 20px #06b6d430;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">🧠</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin:0 0 8px 0;transition:color 0.3s ease;\">AI-Powered Mentor</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin:0;line-height:1.6;\">Get personalized feedback on your code and solutions.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"feature-card\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:20px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <div class=\"feature-icon\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(249,115,22,0.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:0 0 20px #f9731630;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">📐</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin:0 0 8px 0;transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Production Architecture</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin:0;line-height:1.6;\">Learn how real companies build AI systems.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"feature-card\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:20px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <div class=\"feature-icon\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(236,72,153,0.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:0 0 20px #ec489930;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">🎯</div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin:0 0 8px 0;transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Career Focused</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin:0;line-height:1.6;\">Every module prepares you for real job interviews.</p>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "Course Statistics",
            "explanation": "",
            "audio": "The course includes over 20 modules, 120 coding challenges, 200 interactive exercises, and 15 real-world projects.",
            "html_code": "<div style=\"padding:16px 0;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;\">\n    <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;padding:6px 18px;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(99,102,241,0.15);color:#6366f1;margin-bottom:16px;\">Course at a Glance</div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);font-weight:800;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #c4b5fd 0%, #8b5cf6 50%, #3b82f6 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 16px 0;text-align:center;\">Everything you get.</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,20px);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 48px auto;line-height:1.6;font-weight:400;\">A comprehensive learning experience designed to transform you into a production-ready AI engineer.</p>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Bento Grid -->\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);grid-template-rows:auto auto auto;gap:16px;\">\n    <!-- ═══ HERO CARD: 20+ Modules (spans 2 cols) ═══ -->\n    <div style=\"grid-column:span 2;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:24px;padding:40px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99,102,241,0.06) 0%, rgba(139,92,246,0.04) 50%, rgba(6,182,212,0.03) 100%);\" onmouseover=\"this.style.transform='translateY(-3px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 12px 40px rgba(99,102,241,0.15)';this.style.borderColor='rgba(99,102,241,0.25)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.transform='translateY(0)';this.style.boxShadow='none';this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.08)'\">\n      <!-- Background glow -->\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;top:-40px;right:-40px;width:280px;height:280px;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(99,102,241,0.1), transparent 65%);pointer-events:none;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:-60px;left:-30px;width:200px;height:200px;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(139,92,246,0.06), transparent 65%);pointer-events:none;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:20px;\">\n          <div style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(99,102,241,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;\">📚</div>\n          <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;padding:6px 18px;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(99,102,241,0.1);color:rgba(129,140,248,0.9);\">Structured Curriculum</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:clamp(48px,6vw,72px);font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.04em;line-height:1;margin-bottom:8px;\">20+</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);margin-bottom:10px;\">Expert-Curated Learning Modules</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 20px 0;max-width:480px;\">A structured curriculum that takes you from complete beginner to production-ready AI engineer, one carefully designed module at a time.</p>\n        <!-- Module flow pills -->\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;\">\n          <span style=\"padding:6px 14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\">Python</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;\">→</span>\n          <span style=\"padding:6px 14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\">ML</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;\">→</span>\n          <span style=\"padding:6px 14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\">Deep Learning</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;\">→</span>\n          <span style=\"padding:6px 14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\">LLMs</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;\">→</span>\n          <span style=\"padding:6px 14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\">Agents</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;\">→</span>\n          <span style=\"padding:6px 14px;background:rgba(16,185,129,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.2);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(52,211,153,0.8);\">Production ✓</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- ═══ CARD: 120+ Challenges ═══ -->\n    <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:24px;padding:32px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\" onmouseover=\"this.style.transform='translateY(-3px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 12px 40px rgba(59,130,246,0.12)';this.style.borderColor='rgba(59,130,246,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.transform='translateY(0)';this.style.boxShadow='none';this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.08)'\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;top:-30px;right:-30px;width:140px;height:140px;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(59,130,246,0.08), transparent 65%);pointer-events:none;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;\">\n        <div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(59,130,246,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:20px;\">⚡</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,52px);font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.04em;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px;\">120+</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin-bottom:8px;\">Coding Challenges</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);line-height:1.5;margin:0;\">Build confidence through hands-on coding practice.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- ═══ CARD: 15+ Projects ═══ -->\n    <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:24px;padding:32px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\" onmouseover=\"this.style.transform='translateY(-3px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 12px 40px rgba(16,185,129,0.12)';this.style.borderColor='rgba(16,185,129,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.transform='translateY(0)';this.style.boxShadow='none';this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.08)'\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;top:-30px;right:-30px;width:140px;height:140px;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(16,185,129,0.08), transparent 65%);pointer-events:none;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;\">\n        <div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(16,185,129,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:20px;\">🏗️</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,52px);font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.04em;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px;\">15+</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin-bottom:8px;\">Industry Projects</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);line-height:1.5;margin:0;\">Graduate with a portfolio employers will notice.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- ═══ CARD: 200+ Exercises ═══ -->\n    <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:24px;padding:32px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\" onmouseover=\"this.style.transform='translateY(-3px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 12px 40px rgba(168,85,247,0.12)';this.style.borderColor='rgba(168,85,247,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.transform='translateY(0)';this.style.boxShadow='none';this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.08)'\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;top:-30px;right:-30px;width:140px;height:140px;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(168,85,247,0.08), transparent 65%);pointer-events:none;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;\">\n        <div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(168,85,247,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(168,85,247,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:20px;\">🎯</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,52px);font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.04em;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px;\">200+</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin-bottom:8px;\">Interactive Exercises</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);line-height:1.5;margin:0;\">Master every concept through engaging, interactive practice.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- ═══ ROW 3: Three small cards ═══ -->\n    <!-- CARD: 75+ Hours -->\n    <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:24px;padding:28px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 8px 30px rgba(249,115,22,0.1)';this.style.borderColor='rgba(249,115,22,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.transform='translateY(0)';this.style.boxShadow='none';this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.08)'\">\n      <div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(249,115,22,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(249,115,22,0.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;flex-shrink:0;\">⏱️</div>\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:32px;font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1;\">75+</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin-top:4px;\">Hours of Content</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- CARD: Certificate -->\n    <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:24px;padding:28px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 8px 30px rgba(234,179,8,0.1)';this.style.borderColor='rgba(234,179,8,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.transform='translateY(0)';this.style.boxShadow='none';this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.08)'\">\n      <div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(234,179,8,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(234,179,8,0.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;flex-shrink:0;\">🏆</div>\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.1;\">Certificate</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin-top:4px;\">Upon Completion</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- CARD: Lifetime Access -->\n    <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:24px;padding:28px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 8px 30px rgba(6,182,212,0.1)';this.style.borderColor='rgba(6,182,212,0.2)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.transform='translateY(0)';this.style.boxShadow='none';this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.08)'\">\n      <div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(6,182,212,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(6,182,212,0.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;flex-shrink:0;\">♾️</div>\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.1;\">Lifetime Access</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin-top:4px;\">Learn at Your Pace</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Premium Badges Row -->\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-top:24px;\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:100px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\"><span style=\"color:#10b981;\">✔</span> Beginner Friendly</span>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:100px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\"><span style=\"color:#10b981;\">✔</span> Portfolio Ready</span>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:100px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\"><span style=\"color:#10b981;\">✔</span> Industry Focused</span>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:100px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\"><span style=\"color:#10b981;\">✔</span> Learn by Building</span>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:100px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\"><span style=\"color:#10b981;\">✔</span> AI Mentor Included</span>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:100px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\"><span style=\"color:#10b981;\">✔</span> Regular Updates</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "Who Should Join",
            "explanation": "",
            "audio": "This course is designed for complete beginners with no coding experience, software developers looking to add AI skills, career switchers building a portfolio, and founders who want to build AI-powered products.",
            "html_code": "<style>\n  .audience-card {\n    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  .audience-card:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-6px);\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15) !important;\n  }\n  .audience-card:hover .audience-icon {\n    transform: scale(1.1) rotate(-5deg);\n  }\n  .audience-card:hover h3 {\n    color: #10b981 !important;\n  }\n</style>\n<div style=\"padding:16px 0;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;\">\n    <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;padding:6px 18px;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);color:#10b981;margin-bottom:16px;\">For You</div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);font-weight:800;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #c4b5fd 0%, #8b5cf6 50%, #3b82f6 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 16px 0;text-align:center;\">Is this course for you?</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,20px);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 48px auto;line-height:1.6;font-weight:400;\">Whether you're starting from zero or leveling up, this course meets you where you are.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;\">\n  <div class=\"audience-card\" style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;padding:28px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:20px;align-items:flex-start;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <div class=\"audience-icon\" style=\"font-size:36px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;transition:transform 0.3s ease;\">🌱</div>\n    <div>\n      <h3 style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin:0 0 8px 0;transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Complete Beginners</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin:0;line-height:1.6;\">No coding experience needed. We teach Python from scratch.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"audience-card\" style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;padding:28px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:20px;align-items:flex-start;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <div class=\"audience-icon\" style=\"font-size:36px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;transition:transform 0.3s ease;\">💻</div>\n    <div>\n      <h3 style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin:0 0 8px 0;transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Software Developers</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin:0;line-height:1.6;\">Add AI engineering to your skillset and transition into the most in-demand roles.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"audience-card\" style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;padding:28px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:20px;align-items:flex-start;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <div class=\"audience-icon\" style=\"font-size:36px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;transition:transform 0.3s ease;\">🔄</div>\n    <div>\n      <h3 style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin:0 0 8px 0;transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Career Switchers</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin:0;line-height:1.6;\">Build a portfolio of real AI projects to land your first tech role.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"audience-card\" style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;padding:28px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:20px;align-items:flex-start;cursor:pointer;\">\n    <div class=\"audience-icon\" style=\"font-size:36px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;transition:transform 0.3s ease;\">🚀</div>\n    <div>\n      <h3 style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin:0 0 8px 0;transition:color 0.3s ease;\">Founders & Entrepreneurs</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin:0;line-height:1.6;\">Learn to build and deploy your own AI-powered products.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "Career Outcomes",
            "explanation": "",
            "audio": "After completing this course, you will be qualified for roles including Generative AI Engineer, LLM Engineer, Machine Learning Engineer, Prompt Engineer, AI Product Engineer, Full Stack AI Developer, and AI Solutions Architect.",
            "html_code": "<style>\n  .role-pill:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.05);\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n    filter: brightness(1.2);\n  }\n</style>\n<div style=\"padding:16px 0;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;\">\n    <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;padding:6px 18px;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(236,72,153,0.15);color:#ec4899;margin-bottom:16px;\">Careers</div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);font-weight:800;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #c4b5fd 0%, #8b5cf6 50%, #3b82f6 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 16px 0;text-align:center;\">Where this takes you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,20px);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 48px auto;line-height:1.6;font-weight:400;\">Roles you'll be qualified for after completing this course.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;\">\n  <span class=\"role-pill\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.15);border:1px solid #8b5cf630;border-radius:100px;color:#8b5cf6;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\">Generative AI Engineer</span>\n  <span class=\"role-pill\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:rgba(59,130,246,0.15);border:1px solid #3b82f630;border-radius:100px;color:#3b82f6;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\">LLM Engineer</span>\n  <span class=\"role-pill\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:rgba(99,102,241,0.15);border:1px solid #6366f130;border-radius:100px;color:#6366f1;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\">Machine Learning Engineer</span>\n  <span class=\"role-pill\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:rgba(236,72,153,0.15);border:1px solid #ec489930;border-radius:100px;color:#ec4899;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\">Prompt Engineer</span>\n  <span class=\"role-pill\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);border:1px solid #10b98130;border-radius:100px;color:#10b981;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\">AI Product Engineer</span>\n  <span class=\"role-pill\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:rgba(249,115,22,0.15);border:1px solid #f9731630;border-radius:100px;color:#f97316;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\">Full Stack AI Developer</span>\n  <span class=\"role-pill\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:rgba(6,182,212,0.15);border:1px solid #06b6d430;border-radius:100px;color:#06b6d4;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\">AI Solutions Architect</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "How Learning Works",
            "explanation": "",
            "audio": "Every module follows a proven five-step cycle. Learn the concepts, practice with code, test your knowledge with quizzes, build a real project, and master the topic.",
            "html_code": "<style>\n  .flow-step {\n    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n  }\n  .flow-step:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-8px);\n  }\n  .flow-step:hover .flow-icon {\n    transform: scale(1.15) rotate(5deg);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 25px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 0 45px rgba(255,255,255,0.2) !important;\n    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3) !important;\n  }\n  .flow-step:hover .flow-text {\n    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\n  }\n  .flow-arrow:hover {\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6) !important;\n    transform: translateX(4px);\n  }\n</style>\n<div style=\"padding:16px 0;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,20px);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 48px auto;line-height:1.6;font-weight:400;margin-top:0;\">Every module follows this proven cycle to maximize retention.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n    <div class=\"flow-step\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;\">\n      <div class=\"flow-icon\" style=\"width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;background:#3b82f618;border:1px solid #3b82f630;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:36px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 20px #3b82f610, 0 0 32px #3b82f620;margin-bottom:16px;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">📖</div>\n      <span class=\"flow-text\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">Learn</span>\n    </div><div class=\"flow-arrow\" style=\"font-size:24px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;padding-bottom:40px;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">→</div>\n    <div class=\"flow-step\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;\">\n      <div class=\"flow-icon\" style=\"width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;background:#a855f718;border:1px solid #a855f730;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:36px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 20px #a855f710, 0 0 32px #a855f720;margin-bottom:16px;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">💻</div>\n      <span class=\"flow-text\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">Practice</span>\n    </div><div class=\"flow-arrow\" style=\"font-size:24px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;padding-bottom:40px;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">→</div>\n    <div class=\"flow-step\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;\">\n      <div class=\"flow-icon\" style=\"width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;background:#f9731618;border:1px solid #f9731630;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:36px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 20px #f9731610, 0 0 32px #f9731620;margin-bottom:16px;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">⚡</div>\n      <span class=\"flow-text\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">Quiz</span>\n    </div><div class=\"flow-arrow\" style=\"font-size:24px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;padding-bottom:40px;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">→</div>\n    <div class=\"flow-step\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;\">\n      <div class=\"flow-icon\" style=\"width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;background:#10b98118;border:1px solid #10b98130;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:36px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 20px #10b98110, 0 0 32px #10b98120;margin-bottom:16px;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">🏗️</div>\n      <span class=\"flow-text\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">Build</span>\n    </div><div class=\"flow-arrow\" style=\"font-size:24px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);display:flex;align-items:center;padding-bottom:40px;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">→</div>\n    <div class=\"flow-step\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;\">\n      <div class=\"flow-icon\" style=\"width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;background:#eab30818;border:1px solid #eab30830;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:36px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 20px #eab30810, 0 0 32px #eab30820;margin-bottom:16px;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">🏆</div>\n      <span class=\"flow-text\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;transition:all 0.3s ease;\">Master</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "Let's Start",
            "explanation": "",
            "audio": "Every expert was once a beginner. Every line of code you write makes you better. Your journey to becoming a Generative AI Application Engineer starts now. Click continue to begin.",
            "html_code": "<style>\n  @keyframes rocketFly {\n    0% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(249,115,22,0.3)); }\n    50% { transform: translateY(-15px) rotate(8deg) scale(1.05); filter: drop-shadow(0 15px 20px rgba(249,115,22,0.6)); }\n    100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(249,115,22,0.3)); }\n  }\n  .flying-rocket {\n    animation: rocketFly 3s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n</style>\n<div style=\"padding:48px 0 16px 0;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;position:relative;\">\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:500px;height:300px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(139,92,246,0.12), transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;filter:blur(40px);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"flying-rocket\" style=\"font-size:72px;margin-bottom:32px;position:relative;z-index:1;\">🚀</div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,52px);font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 20px 0;position:relative;z-index:1;\">\n      Your journey starts now.\n    </h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size:18px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);max-width:500px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 36px 0;font-style:italic;position:relative;z-index:1;\">\n      \"Every expert was once a beginner.<br/>Every line of code you write makes you better.\"\n    </p>\n    <!-- CTA Button -->\n    <button onclick=\"document.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(function(b){if(b.textContent.trim().startsWith('Continue')){b.click()}})\" style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;margin-bottom:32px;padding:18px 48px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #3b82f6);border:none;border-radius:16px;cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:0.02em;box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(139,92,246,0.4), 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);transition:transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.transform='translateY(-2px) scale(1.03)';this.style.boxShadow='0 0 40px rgba(139,92,246,0.4), 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.transform='translateY(0) scale(1)';this.style.boxShadow='0 0 30px rgba(139,92,246,0.4), 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)'\">\n      Ready to Begin →\n    </button>\n    <!-- Progress bar -->\n    <div style=\"width:100%;max-width:400px;height:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border-radius:100px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:16px;position:relative;z-index:1;\">\n      <div style=\"width:8%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg, #8b5cf6, #3b82f6);border-radius:100px;box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(139,92,246,0.4);\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.15em;font-weight:700;position:relative;z-index:1;\">Course progress: Ready to begin</p>\n  </div>\n</div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "M001-intro",
      "title": "Introduction to Python",
      "stages": [
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "What is Python?",
            "explanation": "Alright,let's understand what Python actually is. Think of Python as a language that allows humans to communicate with computers in a simple and readable way. \nIt is one of the most popular programming languages because it is easy to learn and can be used to build websites, automate tasks, analyze data, and create AI applications.\n\n[IMAGE:/images/genai/python/in2.png]\n\n**Key Characteristics:**\n• Interpreted Language – Code runs line by line without a separate compilation step.\n• Dynamically Typed – You do not need to specify data types manually.\n• Easy to Read and Write – Its syntax is simple and close to plain English.\n• Huge Library Ecosystem – Thousands of ready-made libraries help solve problems quickly.\n\n**Real-World Usage:** Python is used by companies like Google, Netflix, Instagram, and OpenAI to build applications, process data, and develop AI systems."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "Why Learn Python?",
            "explanation": "Before we start writing code, it is important to understand why Python is so popular.\n`Python` is one of the easiest programming languages to learn. Its syntax is simple and easy to read, which helps beginners focus on learning programming concepts instead of worrying about complicated rules.\n\nAnother reason people love Python is its versatility. With Python, you can build websites, automate everyday tasks, analyze data, create machine learning models, and develop AI applications.\n\nBecause of its simplicity and powerful features, Python is widely used by beginners, software developers, data scientists, and AI engineers around the world.\n\nToday, Python is one of the most valuable skills in technology and opens the door to many exciting career opportunities."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "The Execution Environment",
            "explanation": "Before we start writing Python programs, let's understand how Python runs our code.\n\nWhen you write Python code and click Run, the computer does not understand your code directly. First, the Python Interpreter reads your code and converts it into a format called Bytecode. Then, the Python Virtual Machine (PVM) executes that Bytecode and produces the result.\n\nYou can think of the Interpreter as a translator that converts your Python code into a language the computer can work with.\n\n**Popular Tools:**\n• VS Code – A lightweight editor for writing and running Python code.\n• PyCharm – A powerful IDE with many built-in development features.\n• Jupyter Notebook – An interactive environment for writing code and viewing results step by step.\n\n**Important Note:**\nWhile installing Python, always select the 'Add Python to PATH' option. This allows you to run Python commands from the terminal or command prompt."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "How to Install VS Code in Your Local System",
            "explanation": "Before we start writing Python programs, we need a tool where we can write, run, and debug our code. These tools are called **IDEs (Integrated Development Environments)**.\n\nThere are many IDEs available such as `VS Code, PyCharm, Jupyter Notebook, Spyder, IDLE, Sublime Text, and IntelliJ IDEA`. In this course, we'll use **Visual Studio Code (VS Code)** because it is the **industry standard**, lightweight, free, and widely used by Python developers, AI Engineers, and Data Scientists.\n\nIf you already have VS Code installed, you can skip the installation steps and follow Steps 7–10 below to make sure Python is installed correctly and your environment is ready. Otherwise, start from Step 1.\n\n### Install VS Code\n\n1. Open the VS Code website: https://code.visualstudio.com\n2. Download VS Code for your operating system.\n3. Run the installer and complete the installation.\n4. Now Lets Open VS Code.\n5. Click the `Extensions` icon on the left sidebar.\n6. Search for `Python` and install the extension provided by `Microsoft`.\n\nIf Python is not installed, download it from the official Python website before continuing.\n\n7. Open a new folder in VS Code.\n8. Create a new file named **main.py**.\n9. Write the following code:\n\n```python\nprint(\"Hello, World!\")\n```\n\n10. Click the **▶ Run** button (or press **Ctrl + F5**).\n\nIf the output displays:\n\n```text\nHello, World!\n```\n\nCongratulations! 🎉 Your Python installation and VS Code setup are working correctly.\n\n### Useful Links\n\n• VS Code: https://code.visualstudio.com\n• Python Download: https://www.python.org/downloads\n\n**Key Idea:** VS Code is the preferred IDE for professional software development, AI, Machine Learning, and Generative AI projects. Throughout this course, we'll use VS Code for all coding examples."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "visual",
          "content": {
            "title": "How Python Executes Code",
            "diagram": [
              "Write Code (.py)",
              "Python Interpreter",
              "Bytecode (.pyc)",
              "Python Virtual Machine",
              "Output"
            ],
            "explanation": "Python first converts your code into Bytecode and then executes it using the Python Virtual Machine."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "challenge": {
            "title": "Run Your First Python Program",
            "question": "The code below is already written for you. Click the **Run** button to execute the program and observe the output. If you see **Hello Python** displayed on the screen, congratulations! You have successfully run your first Python program.",
            "starterCode": "print('Hello Python')",
            "solution": "print('Hello Python')",
            "language": "python",
            "hint": "Simply click the **Run** button. You don't need to write any code for this exercise."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "Comments in Python",
            "explanation": "Comments are notes written inside code that Python ignores during execution. Developers use comments to explain logic and make code easier to understand.\n\n• Single-line comments start with the # symbol.\n• Multi-line comments can be written using triple quotes (''' ''' or \"\"\" \"\"\").\n\nComments improve code readability and make it easier for others to understand your program.",
            "example": "# This is a single-line comment\n\n'''This is a multi-line comment\nthat spans multiple lines'''\n\nprint('Hello Python')"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "challenge": {
            "title": "Using Comments",
            "question": "Add a comment that is Display welcome message before the print statement.",
            "starterCode": "print('Welcome')",
            "solution": "# Display welcome message\nprint('Welcome')",
            "language": "python",
            "hint": "Comments start with #."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "fill_blank",
          "challenge": {
            "title": "Python Basics",
            "question": "Drag and drop the correct term into the blank.",
            "template": [
              "Python Code Runner → ____",
              "Python Bytecode Executor → ____",
              "Single Line Comment Symbol → ____",
              "Most Popular Python Editor → ____"
            ],
            "answers": {
              "0": "Interpreter",
              "1": "PVM",
              "2": "#",
              "3": "VS Code"
            },
            "options": [
              "##",
              "/",
              "Interpreter",
              "PVM",
              "#",
              "VS Code",
              "Compiler",
              "Java"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "reorder",
          "challenge": {
            "instruction": "Arrange the Python execution process in the correct order.",
            "correctOrder": [
              "Write Python Code",
              "Python Interpreter Reads Code",
              "Generate Bytecode",
              "Python Virtual Machine Executes Bytecode",
              "Display Output"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "Lesson Summary",
            "explanation": "In this lesson, you learned what Python is, why it is popular, how Python code executes, the tools used by professional developers, how to write your first program, and the basic syntax rules that every Python developer should know.\n\nYou are now ready to start working with Variables and Data Types."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "M001-variables-data-types",
      "title": "Variable and Types",
      "stages": [
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "Variables as Memory Containers",
            "explanation": "Now that you have learned what Python is and how to write basic Python code, let's learn how Python stores information.\n\nIn real-world programs, we often need to store data such as names, ages, marks, prices, or other information. To store this data, Python provides something called a **variable**.\n\nA **variable** is a named storage location in memory. When you assign a value to a variable, Python stores that value and allows you to use it later in your program.\n **For Example:** Let's say `x = 20` We create a variable named x and store the value 20 inside it.\nYou can think of a variable as a labeled box. The label helps you identify the box, and the value inside the box is the data being stored.\n\nOne useful feature of Python is that you do not need to specify the data type manually. Python automatically detects the type of value being stored. This feature is called **dynamic typing**.\n\nIn the diagram below, each variable stores a value in memory, and the variable name acts as a label that helps access the stored value.",
            "visual": {
              "type": "memory_boxes",
              "diagram": [
                {
                  "label": "name",
                  "value": "'Alex'"
                },
                {
                  "label": "age",
                  "value": "25"
                },
                {
                  "label": "is_student",
                  "value": "True"
                }
              ],
              "caption": "Each variable points to a value stored in memory"
            },
            "interactive": {
              "type": "drag_drop",
              "instruction": "Match each variable to the correct value:",
              "leftItems": [
                "name",
                "age",
                "is_student"
              ],
              "rightOptions": [
                "'John''",
                "25",
                "True",
                "'John'",
                "False",
                "22'"
              ],
              "correctPairs": [
                {
                  "left": "name",
                  "right": "'John'"
                },
                {
                  "left": "age",
                  "right": "25"
                },
                {
                  "left": "is_student",
                  "right": "True"
                }
              ]
            },
            "example": "x = 10\nx = 'Ten'  # Python allows changing type",
            "quick_rules": [
              "Use clear names → user_age",
              "Use snake_case → user_speed",
              "Do not start with numbers → ❌ 1year, ✅ year1"
            ],
            "html_code": "<iframe style=\"width:100%; min-height:380px; border:none; background:transparent;\" srcdoc=\"<style>body{margin:0;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:transparent;color:#f8fafc;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;flex-direction:column;}.container{background:#0f172a;border:1px dashed #334155;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;width:100%;max-width:600px;text-align:center;}.title{color:#64748b;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:20px;text-transform:uppercase;}.memory-grid{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:24px;}.var-box{background:#1e293b;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:8px;width:120px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);}.var-name{background:#334155;padding:8px;font-size:12px;color:#cbd5e1;font-family:monospace;font-weight:bold;}.var-val{padding:16px 8px;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#38bdf8;word-break:break-all;}.controls{background:#1e1b4b;border:1px solid #4f46e5;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;flex-direction:column;}.inputs-row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;}select{background:#020617;border:1px solid #334155;color:white;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;outline:none;cursor:pointer;}select:focus{border-color:#818cf8;}button{background:#4f46e5;color:white;border:none;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;transition:background 0.2s;}button:hover{background:#6366f1;}#msg{margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;min-height:16px;font-weight:bold;opacity:0;transition:opacity 0.3s;}@keyframes popIn{0%{transform:scale(0.8);opacity:0;}100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1;}}.new-box{animation:popIn 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175,0.885,0.32,1.275) forwards;border-color:#4ade80;}.new-box .var-name{background:#14532d;color:#86efac;}.new-box .var-val{color:#4ade80;}</style><div class='container'><div class='title'>EACH VARIABLE POINTS TO A VALUE STORED IN MEMORY \n Choose a variable name and a value, then click Assign memory to create a new variable.</div><div class='memory-grid' id='grid'><div class='var-box'><div class='var-name'>name</div><div class='var-val'>'Alex'</div></div><div class='var-box'><div class='var-name'>age</div><div class='var-val'>25</div></div><div class='var-box'><div class='var-name'>is_student</div><div class='var-val'>True</div></div></div><div class='controls'><div class='inputs-row'><select id='vName'><option value=''>-- Variable --</option><option value='score'>score</option><option value='status'>status</option><option value='pi'>pi</option><option value='is_ready'>is_ready</option></select><span style='color:#64748b;'>=</span><select id='vVal'><option value=''>-- Value --</option><option value='100'>100</option><option value='&amp;apos;Online&amp;apos;'>'Online'</option><option value='3.14159'>3.14159</option><option value='True'>True</option></select><button onclick='addVar()'>Assign Memory</button></div><div id='msg'></div></div></div><script>function addVar(){const nSel=document.getElementById('vName');const vSel=document.getElementById('vVal');const name=nSel.value;const val=vSel.value;const msg=document.getElementById('msg');if(!name || !val){msg.innerText='Please select BOTH a variable and a value!';msg.style.color='#f87171';msg.style.opacity=1;setTimeout(()=>{msg.style.opacity=0;},3000);return;}const grid=document.getElementById('grid');const box=document.createElement('div');box.className='var-box new-box';box.innerHTML=`<div class='var-name'>${name}</div><div class='var-val'>${val}</div>`;grid.appendChild(box);msg.innerText='Success! Variable assigned: ' + name + ' = ' + val;msg.style.color='#4ade80';msg.style.opacity=1;setTimeout(()=>{msg.style.opacity=0;},3500);nSel.value='';vSel.value='';}</script>\"></iframe>"
          }
