              "The ____ property returns the size of a tensor.",
              "The ____ property returns the number of dimensions of a tensor.",
              "The ____ function creates a tensor filled with zeros.",
              "The ____ function converts a NumPy array into a PyTorch tensor.",
              "The ____ method converts a PyTorch tensor back into a NumPy array."
            ],
            "options": [
              "torch.from_numpy()",
