            ],
            "answers": {
              "blank_1": "shape",
              "blank_2": "ndim",
              "blank_3": "torch.zeros()",
              "blank_4": "torch.from_numpy()",
              "blank_5": "numpy()"
            },
            "explanation": "shape returns the tensor size, ndim returns the number of dimensions, torch.zeros() creates a tensor of zeros, torch.from_numpy() converts a NumPy array into a tensor, and numpy() converts a tensor back into a NumPy array.",
            "hint": "Think about tensor properties, tensor creation, and NumPy conversion."
