          "context": "A data scientist collected 500 photos of Golden Retrievers to train an AI. All 500 photos were taken outdoors on sunny days, with the dogs facing perfectly forward. The model gets 99% accuracy in the lab. However, when deployed in a mobile app, users complain that the AI fails to recognize Golden Retrievers if they are lying down, or if the photo is taken indoors at night.",
