            "solution": "model = Sequential([\n    Conv2D(32,(3,3),activation='relu',input_shape=(28,28,1)),\n    MaxPooling2D((2,2)),\n    Flatten(),\n    Dense(10,activation='softmax')\n])",
            "language": "python",
            "hint": "Pooling reduces feature map size."
          }
