                "BoW creates high-dimensional sparse arrays with no meaning, while Word Embeddings create low-dimensional dense vectors that capture semantic context.",
                "BoW is only used for Neural Networks, while Word Embeddings are only used for Random Forests."
              ],
              "answer": 2,
              "explanation": "Bag of Words generates a massive, sparse matrix consisting mostly of zeros (one for every word in the dictionary). Word embeddings compress meaning into a dense array of numbers where math can be applied."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
