            "example": "You are a Business Strategy Consultant.\n\nContext:\nI need to analyze a quarterly sales report and prepare insights for executive leadership.\n\nYour tasks:\n1. Summarize the overall business performance.\n2. Identify key sales trends.\n3. Highlight major risks.\n4. Identify growth opportunities.\n5. Recommend actionable next steps.\n6. Keep the report concise and suitable for senior executives.\n\nResponse Format:\n- Executive Summary\n- Key Trends\n- Risks\n- Opportunities\n- Recommended Next Steps\n\nSales Report:\n[paste quarterly sales report here.\n].\nLet's look at the prompt below and understand how it is structured."
          }
