            "title": "Prompting for Marketing Professionals",
            "explanation": "Marketing teams use AI to generate social media posts, email campaigns, product launches, advertisements, SEO content, and customer engagement strategies. High-quality prompts specify the target audience, brand voice, platform, campaign objective, and desired call to action.\nLet's look at the prompt below and understand how it is structured.",
            "example": "You are a Digital Marketing Expert.\n\nContext:\nI want to announce our new AI-powered Resume Builder on LinkedIn for software engineers.\n\nYour tasks:\n1. Write an engaging LinkedIn post.\n2. Start with an attention-grabbing opening.\n3. Highlight the key benefits of the product.\n4. Include a clear call to action.\n5. Add relevant hashtags.\n6. Keep the tone professional and the length around 250 words.\n\nResponse Format:\n- LinkedIn Post\n- Hashtags\n\nProduct:\nAI-powered Resume Builder"
