            "hint": "Use list comprehension or a simple loop with string slicing [i:i+chunk_size].",
            "solution": "def chunk_text(text, chunk_size):\n    return [text[i:i+chunk_size] for i in range(0, len(text), chunk_size)]\n\nresume = \"Alex is an AI Engineer. He works with React and Python. He lives in Delhi.\"\nprint(chunk_text(resume, 25))"
