            "solution": "from peft import LoraConfig\n\nlora_config = LoraConfig(\n    r=16,\n    lora_alpha=32,\n    target_modules=['q_proj', 'v_proj'],\n    lora_dropout=0.05,\n    task_type='CAUSAL_LM'\n)",
            "hint": "Set r=16, lora_alpha=32 (2x the rank), target_modules=['q_proj', 'v_proj'], lora_dropout=0.05, and task_type='CAUSAL_LM'.",
