            "hint": "Set deepspeed='ds_config.json' — that's all you need to enable DeepSpeed with HuggingFace TrainingArguments.",
            "explanation": "DeepSpeed integration with HuggingFace is remarkably simple — just pass a config file path. The TrainingArguments class handles all the distributed setup. The ds_config.json file specifies the ZeRO stage and memory optimization settings.",
