            "starterCode": "from typing import TypedDict, Annotated\n\n# Write the reducer function\ndef merge_lists(existing: list, new: list) -> list:\n    ___\n\n# Create the State using the reducer\nclass CrawlerState(TypedDict):\n    visited_pages: ___",
