            "starterCode": "# Create the config with a thread_id\nconfig = ___\n\n# This is how you'd use it:\n# result = graph.invoke({'messages': [('human', 'Hello!')]}, config=config)",
            "solution": "config = {'configurable': {'thread_id': 'user_alice_session_1'}}",
