              "front": "What are the four types of agent memory?",
              "back": "1. Short-term (working) — current conversation buffer\n2. Long-term (persistent) — facts across sessions in a vector DB\n3. Episodic — records of past task executions\n4. Semantic — accumulated general knowledge"
            },
            {
              "front": "What are the four agentic design patterns (Andrew Ng)?",
              "back": "1. Reflection — agent critiques and improves its own output\n2. Tool Use — agent calls external APIs and functions\n3. Planning — agent creates a plan before executing\n4. Multi-Agent — multiple specialized agents collaborate"
            },
