              "front": "What are the five essential agent guardrails?",
              "back": "1. Iteration limit (max steps)\n2. Token/cost budget\n3. Timeout (wall-clock time)\n4. Tool whitelist (only approved tools)\n5. Human-in-the-loop (approval for dangerous actions)"
            },
            {
              "front": "What does ReAct stand for and what are its three steps?",
              "back": "ReAct = Reasoning + Acting\n1. THOUGHT — LLM reasons about what to do\n2. ACTION — LLM outputs a tool call\n3. OBSERVATION — Tool executes and returns result\nRepeat until final answer."
            }
          ]
        },
