            "description": "You're deploying an MCP server to the cloud that wraps your company's internal CRM system. Multiple AI assistants across the organization will connect to it. What authentication should you use?",
            "choices": [
              {
                "text": "No authentication — the server is behind a VPN.",
                "score": 20,
