              },
              {
                "text": "OAuth 2.0 with client credentials — each AI application gets its own client ID and secret.",
                "score": 100,
                "outcome": "Correct! OAuth 2.0 client credentials is the recommended approach for service-to-service MCP connections. Each AI app authenticates independently, and you can revoke access per-app."
