              {
                "text": "Hardcode a shared password in each AI application.",
                "score": 0,
                "outcome": "Never hardcode credentials! If one app is compromised, all apps are compromised. Use proper secret management (environment variables, vault) with unique credentials per client."
              }
            ]
          }
        },
