              "explanation": "Synchronous connections block while waiting for external API calls. 500 simultaneous users × 3-second LLM calls = 500 blocked connections. Most databases default to 100 max connections, so the server crashes. Async database drivers (like asyncpg) solve this by releasing the connection while waiting.",
              "answer": 1
