                "Post-filtering doesn't work with HNSW indexes"
              ],
              "correct": 1,
              "explanation": "Because ANN search is approximate (it only checks a subset of vectors), unauthorized tenant documents can 'push out' authorized results from the top-K. Pre-filtering ensures the search only runs within the authorized partition, guaranteeing both security and result quality.",
              "answer": 1
            }
          ]
