          "type": "scenario",
          "content": {
            "title": "Vector RAG vs GraphRAG Decision",
            "description": "Your enterprise knowledge base has 50,000 documents about organizational structure, project histories, and client relationships. A VP asks: 'Show me all the projects managed by people who previously worked with Client X, and what technologies those projects used.' This requires connecting: People → Client relationships → Projects → Technologies. Which approach do you use?",
            "choices": [
