              },
              {
                "text": "MongoDB for everything — it's flexible enough.",
                "score": 15,
                "outcome": "MongoDB lacks ACID guarantees needed for billing, has no native vector search, and is not optimized for caching. Using it for everything would create reliability and performance problems."
