                "score": 50,
                "outcome": "This works but is over-engineered for 50,000 users. pgvector can handle the embedding volume without a separate Pinecone instance. Neo4j is overkill for simple user preference memory — pgvector semantic search handles that. You'd be managing 5 separate databases unnecessarily."
              }
            ]
          }
        },
