            "question": "Write a Colang guardrail configuration that: (1) defines a pattern for users asking about medical advice, and (2) creates a flow that redirects them to consult a doctor instead. Store the config string in a variable called 'colang_config'.",
            "starterCode": "# Write Colang 2.0 guardrail rules\ncolang_config = '''\ndefine user ___\n  \"What medicine should I take?\"\n  \"Is this drug safe?\"\n  \"Diagnose my symptoms\"\n\ndefine flow\n  user ___\n  bot ___\n  \"___\"\n'''",
