              ],
              "answer": 1,
              "explanation": "Direct injection comes from user input (which you can filter). Indirect injection hides in documents, web pages, or emails that the LLM reads through RAG or tools. Since the attack is in the DATA, not the user message, traditional input filters don't catch it."
            },
