            "starterCode": "from litellm import completion\n\nmessages = [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Explain LLMOps in one sentence.'}]\n\n# OpenAI\nresp1 = completion(model=___, messages=messages)\n\n# Anthropic  \nresp2 = completion(model=___, messages=messages)\n\n# Google\nresp3 = completion(model=___, messages=messages)",
            "solution": "from litellm import completion\n\nmessages = [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Explain LLMOps in one sentence.'}]\n\nresp1 = completion(model='gpt-4o-mini', messages=messages)\nresp2 = completion(model='claude-3-haiku-20240307', messages=messages)\nresp3 = completion(model='gemini/gemini-pro', messages=messages)",
