          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "Practice Project: Full-Stack AI Chat Application",
            "explanation": "**Your Capstone Mission:**\n\nBuild a full-stack AI chat application with a polished frontend, real-time streaming responses, conversation history, and multiple AI personas.\n\n**What You Will Build:**\nA \"ChatHub\" application where users can chat with different AI personas (coding tutor, creative writer, data analyst) with streaming responses, conversation management, and a beautiful modern UI.\n\n**Project Requirements:**\n\n1. **Frontend (React/Next.js)**:\n   - Modern chat UI with message bubbles\n   - Real-time streaming (Server-Sent Events or WebSockets)\n   - Persona selector with animated transitions\n   - Markdown rendering in AI responses (code blocks, tables, lists)\n   - Dark/light theme toggle\n   - Mobile responsive design\n\n2. **Backend (Node.js or Python)**:\n   - RESTful API for conversation CRUD\n   - Streaming endpoint for AI responses\n   - User authentication (email + OAuth)\n   - Rate limiting per user\n\n3. **AI Integration**:\n   - Multiple persona system prompts\n   - Context window management (smart truncation)\n   - Token counting and usage tracking\n   - Fallback handling when API is down\n\n4. **Data Persistence**:\n   - Store conversation history in database\n   - Export conversations as markdown\n   - Search across past conversations\n\n5. **Polish & UX**:\n   - Typing indicators while AI is thinking\n   - Copy code button for code blocks\n   - Keyboard shortcuts (Ctrl+Enter to send)\n   - Error states with retry buttons\n\n**Tech Stack:**\n```\nFrontend: Next.js + Tailwind CSS + Framer Motion\nBackend: FastAPI or Express.js\nDatabase: PostgreSQL + Redis (caching)\nAI: OpenAI API with streaming\nAuth: NextAuth.js or Clerk\n```\n\n**Stretch Goals:**\n- Add voice input/output (speech-to-text, text-to-speech)\n- Implement file upload and analysis\n- Add collaborative chat rooms (multiple users + AI)\n\nBuild a ChatGPT-quality experience from scratch!"
          }
        }
      ]
