            ],
            "correctAnswer": 1,
            "explanation": "Docker caches each build layer. By copying requirements.txt first and installing dependencies, Docker can reuse this cached layer on subsequent builds as long as requirements.txt hasn't changed. This saves 5-10 minutes per build since pip install is the slowest step."
