              },
              {
                "text": "Use virtual machines — give each developer an Ubuntu VM with everything pre-installed",
                "feedback": "VMs are heavyweight (GBs of disk, slow boot times) and still require manual setup and maintenance. Docker containers are lighter, faster, and more portable.",
