            "title": "Security Architecture Decision",
            "scenario": "Your AI API is getting 500 requests/minute from legitimate users. Suddenly, you notice 10,000 requests/minute from a single IP address — someone is scraping your model's responses. Your OpenAI bill is spiking to $500/day. What's the best immediate response?",
