          "type": "mcq",
          "content": {
            "question": "Why should you run AI evaluations (evals) in your CI/CD pipeline, not just unit tests?",
            "options": [
              "Because unit tests are outdated and no longer useful",
              "Because AI systems can have code that works correctly but produces poor-quality responses after prompt or model changes",
              "Because AI evals are faster than unit tests",
